        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: McFarland, USA; The Black Hole; Juntos (Together)\n- People: Niki Caro; Mark Ciardi; Gordon Gray; Christopher Cleveland; Bettina Gilois; Grant Thompson; Antônio Pinto; Gary Nelson\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions; Walt Disney Records; Universal Music Latin\n- Topics: film production; soundtrack releases\n\nFacts:\n- The Black Hole is a 1979 American science fiction film directed by Gary Nelson and produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- On January 20, 2015, Walt Disney Records and Universal Music Latin released \"Juntos (Together)\" digitally via the iTunes Store as the lead single from the soundtrack for McFarland, USA.\n- McFarland, USA, also known as McFarland, is a 2015 American sports drama film directed by Niki Caro.\n- McFarland, USA was produced by Mark Ciardi and Gordon Gray, written by Christopher Cleveland, Bettina Gilois, and Grant Thompson, with music composed by Antônio Pinto.",
